<title>NETHERLANDS: FLEXOVIT FIRST-HALF NET FALLS 29 PCT.</title>
<headline>FLEXOVIT FIRST-HALF NET FALLS 29 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>DEVENTER, Netherlands 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.77 vs   1.12</p>
<p>    Net profit			     4.1  vs   5.8</p>
<p>    Turnover				85.6  vs  78.7</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     7.6  vs   8.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Abrasives maker Flexovit International NV said it</p>
<p>expects turnover and profits to improve in the second half of</p>
<p>the year. The company previously said it expected a profit rise</p>
<p>in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
